# Welcome

This is the first article on **doichev.com**.

It was created as a seed article to verify the Keystatic CMS integration is working correctly with Astro Content Collections.

## What's here

- Articles written in Markdoc format
- Managed through the Keystatic admin UI at `/keystatic`
- Rendered with Astro and styled with Tailwind CSS
- Deployed on Cloudflare Pages
